  "schemaVersion": "2.0",
  "day": 36,
  "theme": "Work collocations (make / raise / take)",
  "pillar": "natural",
  "star": false,
  "rule_en": "At work, certain verbs are locked to certain nouns: you make a decision, raise a concern, take ownership, run a test, meet a deadline, draw a conclusion. The verb is fixed by habit, not by logic, so learn the verb and the noun as one chunk.",
  "rule_bn": "অফিসের ইংরেজিতে নির্দিষ্ট verb নির্দিষ্ট noun-এর সঙ্গেই বসে: make a decision, raise a concern, take ownership, run a test, meet a deadline, draw a conclusion। এটা যুক্তি নয়, অভ্যাস — তাই verb আর noun একসাথে মুখস্থ করো।",
